        "description": "This is an introductory course on Computer Vision offered to undergraduate and graduate students. The goal is to develop understanding of the fundamental concepts in computer vision and enable students to understand and develop applications using existing tools. Students will be given theoretical and programming assignments targeted towards solving real-world computer vision problems. Groups of two or three will do a course project and show a demonstration at the end of the semester.",
